ry countryside retreat</div></div><div class="w-layout-grid fda-property-content-details-item"><div class="fda-font-weight-medium fda-color-primary">Vibe :</div><div>Mediterranean Garden Elegance</div></div><div class="w-layout-grid fda-property-content-details-item"><div class="fda-font-weight-medium fda-color-primary">Year restored :</div><div>2025</div></div></div><div class="fda-property-line"></div><div appear="" class="w-layout-vflex fda-property-content-details-part"><div class="w-layout-grid fda-property-content-details-item"><div class="fda-font-weight-medium fda-color-primary">Atmosphere :</div><div>Romantic &amp; Nature-Inspired</div></div><div class="w-layout-grid fda-property-content-details-item"><div class="fda-font-weight-medium fda-color-primary">Capacity :</div><div class="w-layout-hflex fda-venue-details-guest"><div>Up to</div><div>450</div><div>Guests</div></div></div><div class="w-layout-grid fda-property-content-details-item"><div class="fda-font-weight-medium fda-color-primary">Accessibility :</div><div>Gated private garden entrance</div></div></div></div><div class="w-layout-vflex fda-property-details-feature-wrap"><div class="fda-property-details-feature-heading"><div text-appear="v1" class="fda-text-style-h3">Key Property Features</div></div><div appear="" class="fda-venue-details-richtext w-richtext"><p>Surrounded by flourishing olive trees and open countryside landscapes, this estate offers a harmonious blend of refined luxury and rustic charm. Carefully curated pathways, handcrafted stone finishes, and elegant outdoor lounges create a peaceful atmosphere designed for intimate celebrations and elevated wedding experiences. The natural surroundings provide an unforgettable backdrop for ceremonies, receptions, and cinematic photography throughout every season.</p><p>The venue combines timeless architecture with contemporary comforts, featuring expansive banquet lawns, softly illuminated walkways, and thoughtfully designed gathering spaces. Every corner of the property has been arranged to encourage connection, relaxation, and effortless celebration while maintaining an atmosphere of understated sophistication and organic beauty for guests arriving from near and far.</p><h5>Sunlit garden courtyards</h5><p>Beautifully landscaped courtyards are framed with mature olive trees, textured stone pathways, and seasonal floral arrangements, creating serene outdoor spaces perfect for elegant ceremonies, cocktail hours, and intimate evening celebrations beneath soft golden lighting.</p><h5>Signature vineyard-inspired interiors</h5><p>Warm natural materials, rustic timber finishes, and handcrafted dÃ©cor elements draw inspiration from classic vineyard estates, delivering an inviting atmosphere filled with sophistication, comfort, and timeless countryside elegance across every curated event space.</p><h5>Open-air reception pavilion</h5><p>The grand pavilion features flowing drapery, ambient architectural lighting, and panoramic garden views designed to host luxurious receptions with seamless indoor-outdoor transitions, ensuring memorable dining experiences and refined wedding celebrations throughout the evening.</p></div></div><div class="w-layout-vflex fda-property-facilities-wrap"><div text-appear="v1" class="fda-text-style-h4">Amenities &amp; Facilities</div><div appear="" class="w-layout-hflex fda-veune-facilities-list-wrapper"><div class="w-layout-vflex fda-veune-facilities-list"><div class="w-layout-hflex fda-veune-facilities-list-item"><div class="w-layout-vflex fda-venue-details-icon"><img src="{{ asset('images/6a6305be5040b777232a149c_Venue-details-list-icon.svg') }}" loading="lazy" alt="Venue-details-list-icon"/></div><div>Private bridal preparation lounge</div></div><div class="w-layout-hflex fda-veune-facilities-list-item"><div class="w-layout-vflex fda-venue-details-icon"><img src="{{ asset('images/6a6305be5040b777232a149c_Venue-details-list-icon.svg') }}" loading="lazy" alt="Venue-details-list-icon"/>